To add high score tracking, you can store the score in local storage and retrieve it on page load.

```javascript
function saveScore() {
    localStorage.setItem('score', score);
}

function loadScore() {
    score = localStorage.getItem('score') || 0;
}

window.onload = loadScore;
```

